{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXIT LOOPS is a psychological horror game where you\u2019re trapped in a never-ending street loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully observe the street you are on, and when you reach the end, make a decision based on your observations. If you notice an anomaly, choose the door on the right. If you don\u2019t, choose the door on the left and make a decision about that street.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wrong decision sends you back to the beginning.<br>The right ones take you one step closer to the exit.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Technical Info</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: Approximately 1.5 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls: Keyboard and mouse (Move with WASD, look around with mouse)</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666880?t=1767909024","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666880?t=1767909024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666880/c5b3feb0ad0d8d55d4e38f98d09dda2dcf9965de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767909024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666880/c5b3feb0ad0d8d55d4e38f98d09dda2dcf9965de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767909024","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXIT LOOPS is a psychological horror game where you\u2019re trapped in a never-ending street loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carefully observe the street you are on, and when you reach the end, make a decision based on your observations. If you notice an anomaly, choose the door on the right. If you don\u2019